---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact | COM<tech>"
  description="Get in touch with Anders Hybertz at COM<tech> for software architecture, technical leadership, and independent technical advice."
>

  <section class="section contact-section">
    <div class="container contact-layout">

      <div class="contact-left">
        <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="page-h1">Get in touch directly</h1>
        <p class="contact-sub">
          If you have a technical challenge, an architectural decision to make, or need an outside perspective,
          feel free to reach out. The conversation starts directly with Anders.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:anders@comtechconsulting.dk" class="contact-primary-link">
            <span class="contact-link-label">Email</span>
            <span class="contact-link-value">anders@comtechconsulting.dk</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andershybertz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-primary-link">
            <span class="contact-link-label">LinkedIn</span>
            <span class="contact-link-value">linkedin.com/in/andershybertz</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="contact-note">
          Based in Copenhagen. Working with clients across Denmark and internationally. Usually replies within one business day.
        </p>
        <hr class="contact-rule" />
        <p class="contact-note">One senior point of contact from the first message. No account managers. No unnecessary intake steps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-right">
        <p class="contact-process-label">How it usually starts</p>
        <ul class="contact-steps">
          <li>
            <div class="step-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>You write with the context you have</strong>
              <p>A short description is enough. It does not have to be fully structured before the first conversation.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="step-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>We talk through the problem</strong>
              <p>The point is to understand the situation and whether there is a sensible fit. Not to turn the call into a sales exercise.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="step-icon">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Then we decide whether to proceed</strong>
              <p>If there is a good match, we define the next step in a practical way. If not, the conversation should still have been useful.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-section {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .contact-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .contact-sub {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    max-width: 42ch;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .contact-primary-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .contact-primary-link:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .contact-primary-link:hover { background: var(--surface-2); }
  .contact-link-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-3);
    min-width: 64px;
  }
  .contact-link-value {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .contact-primary-link:hover .contact-link-value { color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .contact-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .contact-process-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .contact-steps {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .contact-steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .step-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .contact-steps strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }
  .contact-steps p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .contact-section { padding-top: 3.5rem; padding-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  }
</style>
